---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import PhotoHero from '../components/PhotoHero.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Home">
  <Header />
  <PhotoHero />

  <main>

    <section class="about-section">
      <div class="about-section__content">
        <p class="about-text">
          lewsthoughts is basically a bit of an insight into some of the stuff that I think about. Some ideas are more fleshed out than others.
        </p>
        <p class="about-text">
          I don’t really see myself as much of a writer, but I like to write my thoughts down to help me figure them out and explore them more…
        </p>
        <p class="about-text">
          ... and sometimes they turn into blog posts.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
